OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will begin cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patchy light rain, this mostly in
OL,7,Fthe west. The rain will clear during
OL,8,Fthe afternoon when bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells increase.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fdry with clear spells. Cloud will
OL,13,Fspread east from after midnight with
OL,14,Frain following in the west later.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FBright spells and mostly dry
OL,17,Fin the morning. Cloud and rain, some
OL,18,Fheavy, spread east from the early
OL,19,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
