OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday morning continues cloudy
OL,7,Fwith rain. Wednesday afternoon, early
OL,8,FThursday stays dry, a further band of
OL,9,Fcloud and rain passes southeast
OL,10,FThursday night. Friday will become dry
OL,11,Fwith sunny spells.
